{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1488990-5th-edition-speculation-and-release-date","id":1488990,"title":"5th Edition: speculation and release date?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-03T10:42:46-07:00","id":1488990,"title":"5th Edition: speculation and release date?","content":"Been seeing a little over on Twitter about work going on for Mage 5th Edition; anyone have any work of a potential release date for it yet? What about an idea of what changes are being made to it? Been seeing a lot of speculation that the Technocracy is going to end up as the main antagonist for the story as a whole; anyone have any ideas about the content?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27528-just-some-guy","name":"Just Some Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-03T12:57:48-07:00","id":1489001,"title":"","content":"Absolutley nothing except Achilli saying he's thinking about it. Since Werewolf still needs to be completed that's at least a year (because you know they want that gencon promo) away, and then probably two years of dev to finish at the tempo they are doing things.<br /> <br /> As for what to expect, look at V5, H5 and the info on W5 we have. That's the same level of conjecture that we have right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-03T17:02:15-07:00","id":1489033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1488990-5th-edition-speculation-and-release-date?p=1489001#post1489001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Absolutley nothing except Achilli saying he's thinking about it. Since Werewolf still needs to be completed that's at least a year (because you know they want that gencon promo) away, and then probably two years of dev to finish at the tempo they are doing things.<br /> <br /> As for what to expect, look at V5, H5 and the info on W5 we have. That's the same level of conjecture that we have right now.</div> </div> </div> </div>So basically, F the system (which makes the Technocracy to be Satan and effectively worse than the Nefandi), Traditions are opressive and thus only the crafts are the good guys, and now each rote will have their own ratings... So... Yeah. Probably that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-04T11:24:12-07:00","id":1489138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kakost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1488990-5th-edition-speculation-and-release-date?p=1489033#post1489033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So basically, F the system (which makes the Technocracy to be Satan and effectively worse than the Nefandi), Traditions are opressive and thus only the crafts are the good guys, and now each rote will have their own ratings... So... Yeah. Probably that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why do you think they\u2019re gonna make the Traditions oppressive?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-04T13:35:48-07:00","id":1489146,"title":"","content":"Frankly, if they foul the Traditions up that badly why bother with the setting at all? Noble but disasterously wrong works for the Technocracy, noble but flawed and struggling to be better works for the Traditions. As to the Disperates, they barely work at all. Sure, the Children of Knowledge and the Ngoma seem like viable team players. On the other claw, the Bata'as, the Templers, the Daughters of Hypolyta, the Taftani, and Kops Loea, are defined by not working with others. The Hollow Ones are provably unstable. And the Batini and the Wu Lung are bitter users. They could be associated in very loose ways, but they could never be a faction. <br /> <br /> The Black Dog parody of M:tA was Warlock: the Pretension. Maybe that's the game they want to sell","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-04T15:05:38-07:00","id":1489159,"title":"","content":"I think that Kakost was leaning into the impression that some seem to have that Brucato intended the Disparate Alliance to be the heroes of M20. <br /> <br /> I <i>do</i> have serious concerns that M5 will go overly simplistic on the politics and treat the various factions as stereotypes; they don't have a particularly good track record in that regard with V5 and H5. It's why I hope we can get as much M20 material as possible before M5 goes into development.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_l